# Exposure ceiling of stvor-agent-telemetry.service for make e2e (Stvor plan Task 18
# review): `systemd-analyze security` in the debian:12 container (systemd 252) must
# report «Overall exposure level» at or below it. Lower is better; a hardening that
# lowers the score lowers this pin in the same commit. The full report of a run —
# .scratchpad/test-runs/e2e-*/telemetry-security.txt. The e2e covers systemd 252 only;
# 245 with cgroup v1 (Jetson Nano, L4T R32.6.1) and `verify` on 237 —
# docs/research/2026-10-22-telemetry-budget-jetson.md.
TELEMETRY_EXPOSURE_MAX=3.2
